'''Sector 47''' was an area of [[Realspace|space]] above the [[Forest]] [[Moon]] of [[Endor]]. During the [[Battle of Endor]] in the [[Galactic Civil War]], the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[Star Destroyer]]s were located in Sector 47 and ambushed the [[Rebel Alliance Navy|Alliance Fleet]]. [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]]<ref name="Episode VI" /> [[Mon Calamari]] [[controller]]<ref name="RotJ novel">[[Star Wars: Return of the Jedi (paperback novel)|''Star Wars: Return of the Jedi'' junior novelization]]</ref> [[Verrack]] informed [[Admiral]] [[Gial Ackbar]] about the location of the Imperial vessels.<ref name="Episode VI" />

